---
title:    "Nondeterminism Analysis of Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(ICLP 2005)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/ICLP05.html"
date:     2005-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
